# Discourse Analyzer AI - Project Roadmap

## 🔴 Critical Issues & Bugs
- [ ] **CRITICAL:** Total data loss detected! (Started with 675 lines, ended with 235 lines. Lost 440 lines).
- [x] Quote analysis does not use correct analysis categories according to selected analysis type.
- [ ] Re-evaluating quote does not use latest updated context content.
- [ ] Analysis cleanup may not be working correctly; refresh session data everywhere after cleanup or update.

## 🛡️ Security & DDoS Protection
- [ ] Initial session ID generation from server before accepting browsing or login requests.
- [ ] Implement throttle protection on session creation endpoint.
- [ ] Cache active sessions in Redis for quick validation.
- [ ] Implement Vercel Edge Middleware for edge-level rate limiting.
- [ ] Add email/webhook notifications for critical alerts.
- [ ] Add WebSocket for real-time alert updates.
- [ ] Research and implement further security and DDoS protection measures.

## 🎙️ Transcription & Dialog Analysis
### Normalize GUI flows:
- [ ] Session stage
- [ ] Promoted stage

### Improvements:
- [ ] Support translations for dynamic analysis categories.
- [ ] Improve audit verdict prompt (currently ambiguous) or remove it.
- [ ] Allow saving session state multiple times.
- [ ] Allow selection of specific AI models for different analysis stages:
    - Rough grouping analysis
    - Speaker identification
    - Dialog analysis into topics
    - Topic merging

## 👥 User & Access Management
- [ ] Use DB-stored API keys instead of environment variables.
- [ ] Implement Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for the admin dashboard.

## 📜 Public Quotes
- [ ] Create dedicated API for public quotes listing.
- [ ] Ensure protection of public quotes endpoints against abuse, DDoS, and injection attacks.
- [ ] Implement effective caching for the public quotes listing endpoint.
- [ ] System for promoting quotes to "Public" from the admin dashboard.
- [ ] Moderation system for public quotes.
- [ ] Public display: Hide audit metadata (creator ID, initial analysis, AI model used).

## 📺 Media & Display
- [ ] **TikTok:** Support loading videos from URL.
- [ ] **Previews:** Do not activate embedded previews (e.g., Facebook) until the user clicks the "Load Preview" button.

